<title>USA: Applied Digital agrees to buy software.</title>
<headline>Applied Digital agrees to buy software.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Applied Digital Access Inc said it reached a non-binding agreement with Northern Telecom Ltd to buy Nortel's Digital Support System II (DSS II) operations system software product.</p>
<p>The non-binding agreement calls for ADA to acquire from Nortel an exclusive worldwide license, subject to certain residual rights retained by Nortel, to the DSS II software for cash and ADA common shares. The value of the transaction was not disclosed.</p>
</text>
